p.src:
At the crossover the string formula is valid, so $S_*\sim M_*\ell_s.$ Entropy was unchanged along the path. Combining this statement with Equation [eq:l07-crossover-result] gives the entropy of the original target black hole: $S_{\mathrm{BH}}(M_0)
\sim M_0^2G_{N,0}
\sim M_0^2\ell_{p,0}^2.$ This is the desired area-law scaling.

